WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Well, so, I would like to.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.960
I bet you would like to, but that doesn't mean you're going to.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:04.960
Are you?

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.960
No, no, no.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:11.440
What I'm saying to you is the Congress has statutes on seditious conspiracy, on insurrection,

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.740
on impeding federal law enforcement.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:17.740
The domestic terrorism statute in Congress obviously needs to be strengthened for domestic

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:18.740
terrorism in Congress.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.200
We have foreign terrorism charges.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.600
We have an entire patchwork of federal laws.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:26.240
To the extent that there are charges that apply, we will charge them in every single

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.240
case.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.240
You have impeding law enforcement.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.240
You have seditious conspiracy.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.120
You have a conspiracy to the private rights.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.459
You have assault against law enforcement officers.

00:00:33.459 --> 00:00:38.439
But all of this meets the hallmark textbook definitions of domestic terrorism.

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:42.360
I just want, Boris, I just want you, just for a moment, to step back and think about

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.480
what we're talking about here.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:48.000
President Trump ran and won a campaign on turning back the border invasion.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.000
You said that several times, Stephen.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.000
You have the mayor of Chicago declaring a-

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.000
We have a limited amount of time, so let me ask you-

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.000
And I'll keep saying it.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Let me ask you about the governor of Illinois.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Let me ask you about the governor of Illinois.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000
And he declared a no-go zone.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.000
He declared a no-go zone for ICE.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
We are set to hear from him in just moments.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.000
How is that not insurrection?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Stephen, Stephen.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.200
We're set to hear from J.B. Pritzker in just moments.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.540
He says that you're attempting to inflame tensions and create a war zone.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:11.440
He also says that you are profiling, that you're targeting black and brown people, even

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:14.120
those who turn out to be here legally.

